WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:37.500
Guys The International 2018 was one of
the best TI's we’ve ever seen.

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:43.560
I mean we saw rivalries unfold, we witnessed some unforgettable plays and of course we saw the TI cycle

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:46.880
broken by a team with a rookie on their roster.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:52.040
Now when it comes to OG’s miracle run,
I think Machine may have said it best: “Cinderella

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:54.300
ain’t got nothing on this.”

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:03.139
But of course it wasn’t all tearful moments and drama at TI8

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:07.890
either it had its fair share of fails and funny
moments as well, and we’ve got an entire

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:09.620
video dedicated just to that.

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:18.160
But this right here right now, is about the best of the best -- not just the best in game either

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:22.640
but we'll also be highlighting some of our favourite more serious out of game moments as well.

00:01:23.260 --> 00:01:24.720
"We love the sh*t out of you."

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:32.320
So without further ado, here’s the absolute Best of The International 2018.

00:01:32.480 --> 00:08:56.480
(Casting)

00:08:57.280 --> 00:09:01.760
Man those team fights were so good watching them again makes you wanna stand up

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:03.800
and scream Lakad matataaaag.

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:05.760
But that's not all we have for you.

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:11.640
Oh no. We thought the team fights at this TI specifically were so good, they deserve their own section in this

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:12.320
video.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:13:41.840
(Casting)

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:47.280
Guys as much as we love the underdog moments, the plays, the team fights from this TI.

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:51.800
They wouldn't mean quite as much without some of the more serious out of game moments

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:52.880
that came with them.

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:56.640
And that's true for the winners, and the losers.

00:13:57.280 --> 00:14:01.920
So here are some of our favourite more serious out of game moments from TI8.

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:44.080
(Casting)

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:48.480
"Yesterday, n0tail he got another nickname."

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:49.760
"A new Chinese nickname."

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:52.480
"It's killer. It's like killing machine."

00:14:52.480 --> 00:14:53.400
"Killing machine."

00:14:53.480 --> 00:14:54.760
"That is so bada*s"

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:58.180
"Yeah there's a sentence about n0tail."

00:14:58.180 --> 00:14:58.900
"Okay what's the sentence."

00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:00.980
"I'm a killer, I have no emotion."

00:15:00.980 --> 00:15:03.560
"This is what the Chinese community is saying about n0tail."

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:09.020
"I mean to be fair after that performance, and that picture that will forever live on in our minds."

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:09.980
"Shake your hand."

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:11.240
"Are we doing it?"

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:13.840
"I'm a killer, I have no emotion."

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:18.460
"You know there's a lot of teams here that have something against us as a team so,

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:22.860
It's not too hard to find like rivals. But I hope Optic yeah."

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:25.000
"You feel like there's a lot of teams against you here?"

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:29.060
"I mean it's just like every time we play against somebody, there's always some problem.

00:15:29.060 --> 00:15:33.120
You know I know OG had a lot of bitterness towards us, I don't know why, I feel like

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:40.260
There's obviously no villain in this story, two teams came out better. But yeah I guess we just have to take it

00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:41.020
as it comes."

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:42.560
"No bad blood from your side."

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.520
"No not really."

00:16:06.180 --> 00:17:08.260
(Casting)

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:10.480
"SumaiL what's your motivation."

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:11.220
"Uh money."

00:17:11.220 --> 00:17:11.720
"Money?"

00:17:11.720 --> 00:17:12.220
"Yeah."

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:13.060
"Definitely."

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:17.660
"Everyone else is gonna tell you they're playing cause they're passionate. They love the game."

00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:19.200
"No."

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:22.080
"I mean that's a good thing right like I'm the best at it."

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:24.880
"But I can also make money out of it, so it's a bonus."

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:25.940
"If you had to pick one."

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:27.040
"Money or the ego?"

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:27.800
"Or the title."

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:31.460
"What am I gonna do with a title, I'll take the money."

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:34.580
"What are you doing Fogged?"

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:39.880
"It clearly says on the schedule you're to be casting this game with me. This is meant to be our year Fogged."

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:42.060
"And you're gonna stand me up like this."

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:44.960
"I'm here on my own casting OpenAI."

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:47.280
"It's not gonna be any fun at all is it?"

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:52.540
"What's up."

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:53.440
"Hello."

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:54.580
"How's it going."

00:17:54.580 --> 00:17:56.460
"I feel like I'm in trouble."

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:58.760
"You've turned up Bruno."

00:18:00.060 --> 00:18:04.980
"Ladies and gentlemen both teams are ready for the match and to bring you the Grand Finals it's

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:09.240
ODPixel, Fogged, and Ben "Merlini" Wu."

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:15.080
"Reso was a poor guy. From a small town called Nikopol."

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:19.060
"And one internet cafe was the worst internet in Europe."

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:24.220
"So when he finished his middle school he decided I need to start my career,

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:26.320
I need to start playing seriously in this game.

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:30.600
So he moved to Kiev, the capital of Ukraine, big city.

00:18:30.740 --> 00:18:38.040
And he was going every day to internet cafe, he was sitting next to one of his friends.

00:18:38.500 --> 00:18:44.140
He was watching his friends play some Dota. He was trying to learn something from that guy.

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:48.340
And when that guy was asking, "Come on Roman bring me some water. I want to drink some water

00:18:48.340 --> 00:18:48.920
bring me some.

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:50.540
Sandwich I want to eat a sandwich."

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:52.000
Reso was doing that.

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:54.280
And that guy was AlwaysWannaFly."

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:55.340
"Legion."

00:18:56.760 --> 00:18:57.800
"Nyet legion."

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:04.220
"I do want to talk about that, is it true that Reso used to get you water?"

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:06.100
"Yeah, for two years."

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:06.700
"For two years?"

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:08.360
"Yeah, in internet cafe."

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:09.740
"And he drink my water."

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:11.880
"Were you surprised he agreed to do that?"

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:12.400
"Yeah."

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:14.220
"Now it is my job."

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:17.140
"Thank you."

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:20.220
"Do you feel a little bit responsible for some of his success?"

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:21.220
"A bit."

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:22.340
"Yeah a bit."

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:25.560
"AlwaysWannaFly was the first friend of Reso in Dota."

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:30.840
"He brought Reso to professional Dota. And today Reso defeated AlwaysWannaFly in a

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:32.180
main stage of TI."

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:37.720
"I was trying to hold my tears."

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:41.780
(Casting)

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:46.660
"We love the sh*t out of you."

00:19:56.660 --> 00:20:02.540
"Like it doesn't matter if it's a fan somewhere or a distant relative, or anybody that's really close to you it's just

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:07.140
having it said out loud, I mean it makes all the difference in the world."

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:10.520
"In a way it's the only way we can help carry this burden for you."

00:20:10.720 --> 00:20:12.180
"As much as we can."

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:18.780
"I mean it has made a difference, it's crazy how different it is."

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:21.800
"Thank you for coming out the Netherlands though."

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:23.760
"It was great, I love your family."

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:27.740
"Yeah, I'm sure they love you but you did make every single one of them cry."

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:28.320
"Sorry."

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:32.180
"Godz I didn't think there was anyone more teary than me on this."

00:20:32.180 --> 00:20:34.200
"I think you might have beaten me buddy. You alright?"

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:38.980
"Okay, I think we'll move on."

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:42.120
"But thank you. Sheever, thank you."

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:45.800
"Alright I'm gonna steal the cheese, screw all of you."

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:46.760
"Hey hey hey."

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:48.320
"I am Dutch if anything."

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:50.340
"Oh yeah that's right the Dutchies like their cheese."

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:52.000
"Bon appetit my queen."

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:01.300
Well guys that's all we got for you on this episode of Best Of.

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:06.300
Now let me tell you, this video could have been about twice as long. I mean what a TI.

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:11.140
We saw the cycle broken, and the Aegis of Champions lifted by a rookie no less.

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:13.760
Alongside of course our little flower n0tail.

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:19.260
Now if you want more help fighting the post-TI blues. I suggest you go ahead and echoslam that subscribe

00:21:19.260 --> 00:21:19.780
button.

